 /* Private A5XELTE Mali resource protocol, version 1.
  * This is deliberately not IOGPU, IOAccelerator, AGX or Metal. No selector
  * accepts a GPU command, physical address, GPU virtual address or shader.
+ * SampleTile runs one fixed 16x16 texture fixture synchronously; its two
+ * hardware fences are complete before this method returns.
  */
